    rule2Title: "2. 严守“水沸腾后再加盐”铁律，杜绝氯离子点蚀",
    rule2Text: "切勿在未烧开的冷水中直接撒入食盐！未溶解的盐粒沉入锅底，局部超高浓度的氯离子（Cl⁻）会在数分钟内侵蚀破坏不锈钢钝化膜，形成不可逆的微观点蚀坑，变成日后化学溶出的加速反应源。务必等水完全剧烈沸腾后方可加盐。",
    rule3Title: "3. 镍敏感及SNAS皮炎患者严格禁用304/316锅烹饪酸食",
    rule3Text: "若家庭成员患有接触性皮炎或全身性镍过敏综合征（SNAS），日常炖煮番茄酸汤切勿使用含镍高达10%的304或316钢。应果断换用430铁素体无镍不锈钢、微晶玻璃珐琅铸铁锅（Le Creuset/Staub）或医用纯钛锅具。",
    rule4Title: "4. 严禁将酸性菜肴留在不锈钢锅中冷藏过夜",
    rule4Text: "烹饪完成的番茄牛肉、酸汤鱼等高酸菜肴，必须立刻盛入高硼硅玻璃保鲜盒或陶瓷器皿中再放入冰箱。高酸液体在冷藏静置状态下与空气界面接触会诱发严重的气液交界氧浓差微电池腐蚀，使大量重金属离子缓慢溶解进菜汁中。",
    copyReportBtn: "复制诊断评估分析报告",
    copiedFeedback: "报告已成功复制到剪贴板！"
  },
  ja: {
    badge: "金属学＆毒性学シミュレーター",
    title: "ステンレス調理器具 重金属（ニッケル＆クロム）酸溶出モデル",
    subtitle: "304 vs 316 vs 430 vs 200系ステンレス鋼の酸性食品における金属イオン解離、新品時の溶出サージ、有機酸キレート速度論、全身性ニッケルアレルギー（SNAS）リスクを欧州CM/Res(2013)9規格に準拠してシミュレーション。",
    controlsTitle: "調理器具の冶金仕様＆調理パラメータ設定",
    controlsSub: "ステンレス鋼グレード、表面不動態皮膜の状態、食品の酸度マトリックス、加熱沸騰時間、調理温度を指定してください。",
    gradeLabel: "ステンレス鋼の合金グレード：",
    gradeHelp: "オーステナイト304 (18/10) vs 316手術用 vs フェライト430ニッケルフリー vs 200系安価鋼 vs ホーロー。",
    conditionLabel: "表面状態および不動態化レベル：",
    conditionHelp: "新品未不動態（Kamerudサージ）vs 成熟した安定不動態皮膜 vs 金属たわし摩擦傷 vs 塩化物孔食。",
    foodLabel: "調理食材の酸性マトリックス：",
    foodHelp: "トマトボロネーゼ煮込み (pH 3.8) vs レモン酢還元ソース vs 酢入り長時間骨スープ vs 塩水沸騰 vs 冷蔵放置。",
    durationLabel: "加熱調理・接触継続時間（分）：",
    durationHelp: "長時間の沸騰加熱は有機酸による金属キレート溶出を有意に加速させます。",
    tempLabel: "調理・煮沸温度 (°C)：",
    tempHelp: "高温環境はアレニウス式に従い、Cr2O3不動態酸化皮膜の酸分解を促進します。",
    servingsLabel: "1食あたりの摂取量（グラム）：",
    servingsHelp: "経口ニッケル・クロム摂取量を算出するための標準的な食事ポーション。",
    presetsTitle: "クイック診断シナリオ：",
    presetNewTomato: "🍅 新品304鍋で初めて作るトマトボロネーゼ（初期溶出サージ）",
    presetSurgicalReduction: "🍋 316医療用ステンレスでのレモン酢ソース（モリブデン高耐酸）",
    presetSnas430: "🛡️ 430ニッケルフリー鋼でのトマト煮込み（ニッケルアレルギー安全）",
    presetScouredBroth: "🍲 傷ついた304鍋で8時間煮込む骨スープ（累積金属溶出）",
    presetOvernightChili: "🧊 酸性シチューを鍋のまま一晩冷蔵保存（液面界面腐食）",
    presetEnamelZero: "🥘 ホーロー鍋での高酸性調理（重金属完全ゼロ基準）",
    diagnosticTitle: "重金属毒性評価＆国際安全基準適合判定",
    diagnosticSub: "ニッケル（Ni）およびクロム（Cr）の食品移行濃度、欧州評議会CM/Res(2013)9基準適合性、臨床アレルギーリスクのリアルタイム計算。",
    hazardScoreLabel: "重金属溶出リスク総合スコア",
    niLeachedLabel: "食品中ニッケル（Ni）移行濃度",
    crLeachedLabel: "食品中クロム（Cr）移行濃度",
    niDoseLabel: "1食あたりの経口ニッケル摂取量",
    snasRiskLabel: "全身性ニッケルアレルギー（SNAS）発症リスク",
    coeComplianceLabel: "欧州CM/Res(2013)9適合ステータス",
    metallicTasteLabel: "金属臭・異味＆酸敗酸化指数",
    alertTitle: "臨床安全性および材料毒性総合所見",
    tableTitle: "主要ステンレス鋼グレードの金属特性・毒性プロファイル比較",
    tableSub: "ニッケル含有量、クロム不動態保護能力、耐孔食指数（PREN）、アレルギー適性を網羅。",
    colGrade: "合金グレード",
    colComposition: "公称化学成分",
    colPren: "PREN耐孔食指数",
    colNiContent: "ニッケル含有率(%)",
    colAcidTolerance: "沸騰酸耐性",
    colSnasSuitability: "ニッケルアレルギー適性",
    rulesTitle: "ステンレス鍋で安全に調理するための4大科学原則",
    rulesSub: "重金属の急激な溶出を防ぎ、鍋を長期保護するためのエビデンスに基づく操作基準。",
    rule1Title: "1. 新品鍋は使用前に「15分酢水煮沸」で不動態化させる",
    rule1Text: "新品のステンレス鍋でいきなりトマトソースを作ってはいけません。カリフォルニア大学デービス校（Kamerudら、2013）の研究により、新品未処理の鍋は通常時の最大6.8倍のニッケルと8.5倍のクロムを溶出することが判明しています。使用前に水と白酢を1:1で入れ15分間弱火で沸騰させ、強固なCr2O3不動態酸化皮膜を形成させてください。",
    rule2Title: "2. 塩化物孔食を防ぐため「塩は必ず完全沸騰後」に投入する",
    rule2Text: "冷水に直接塩を入れてはいけません。底に沈殿した未溶解の塩結晶は高濃度の塩化物イオン（Cl⁻）を放出し、不動態皮膜を破壊して不可逆的なミクロ孔食を発生させます。塩は必ず沸騰（100°C）して激しく対流している状態の時に加えてください。",
    rule3Title: "3. SNAS・アレルギー体質者は304/316での酸性調理を回避する",
    rule3Text: "接触皮膚炎や全身性ニッケルアレルギー（SNAS）をお持ちの方は、ニッケルを10%以上含む304や316鋼での酸性料理を避けてください。ニッケルを実質的に含まない430フェライト系ステンレス、ホーロー鋳鉄鍋（ル・クルーゼ等）、純チタン鍋、または耐熱ガラス容器を選択してください。",
    rule4Title: "4. 酸性料理を調理した鍋のまま冷蔵庫で一晩放置しない",
    rule4Text: "トマト料理や酸味のあるスープが完成したら、鍋のまま冷やすのではなく、直ちにガラスまたは陶器の密閉容器に移し替えてください。冷えた酸性液体が静置状態で酸素と接触し続けると、液面境界で酸素濃淡電池が形成され、金属腐食が進行して料理に金属が溶出します。",
    copyReportBtn: "診断レポートをクリップボードにコピー",
    copiedFeedback: "レポートがクリップボードにコピーされました！"
  }
};

const d = DICTIONARY[lang];
---

<section class="my-10 bg-surface rounded-3xl border border-hairline p-6 md:p-10 shadow-xs">
  <!-- Header -->
  <div class="max-w-4xl mb-8">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider bg-slate-100 text-slate-800 mb-3 border border-slate-200">
      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-slate-600 animate-pulse"></span>
      {d.badge}
    </div>
    <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-ink tracking-tight mb-3">
      {d.title}
    </h2>
    <p class="text-body text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed">
      {d.subtitle}
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Presets Bar -->
  <div class="mb-8 p-4 bg-surface-soft rounded-2xl border border-hairline">
    <span class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted mb-3 font-mono">
      {d.presetsTitle}
    </span>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
      <button 
        type="button" 
        data-preset="new-tomato" 
        class="preset-btn px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium bg-surface border border-hairline hover:border-slate-400 hover:bg-slate-50 transition-all text-ink cursor-pointer"
      >
        {d.presetNewTomato}
      </button>
      <button 
        type="button" 
        data-preset="surgical-reduction" 
        class="preset-btn px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium bg-surface border border-hairline hover:border-slate-400 hover:bg-slate-50 transition-all text-ink cursor-pointer"
      >
        {d.presetSurgicalReduction}
      </button>
      <button 
        type="button" 
        data-preset="snas-430" 
        class="preset-btn px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium bg-surface border border-hairline hover:border-slate-400 hover:bg-slate-50 transition-all text-ink cursor-pointer"
      >
        {d.presetSnas430}
      </button>
      <button 
        type="button" 
        data-preset="scoured-broth" 
        class="preset-btn px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium bg-surface border border-hairline hover:border-slate-400 hover:bg-slate-50 transition-all text-ink cursor-pointer"
      >
        {d.presetScouredBroth}
      </button>
      <button 
        type="button" 
        data-preset="overnight-chili" 
        class="preset-btn px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium bg-surface border border-hairline hover:border-slate-400 hover:bg-slate-50 transition-all text-ink cursor-pointer"
      >
        {d.presetOvernightChili}
      </button>
      <button 
        type="button" 
        data-preset="enamel-zero" 
        class="preset-btn px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium bg-surface border border-hairline hover:border-slate-400 hover:bg-slate-50 transition-all text-ink cursor-pointer"
      >
        {d.presetEnamelZero}
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-start mb-10">
    <!-- Controls Column (7 cols) -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6 bg-surface-soft p-6 md:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-hairline">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink mb-1">{d.controlsTitle}</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-muted leading-relaxed">{d.controlsSub}</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Steel Grade Select -->
      <div>
        <label for="steel-grade-select" class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-ink mb-2">
          {d.gradeLabel}
        </label>
        <select 
          id="steel-grade-select" 
          class="w-full bg-surface border border-hairline rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-sm text-ink font-medium focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-500 focus:outline-hidden"
        >
          {steelData.steelGrades.map((grade) => (
            <option value={grade.id} selected={grade.id === 'grade-304-18-10'}>
              {grade.name} [Ni: {grade.nickelPercent}%, Cr: {grade.chromiumPercent}%, PREN: {grade.prenScore}]
            </option>
          ))}
        </select>
        <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-1.5">{d.gradeHelp}</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Pan Surface Condition -->
      <div>
        <label for="pan-condition-select" class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-ink mb-2">
          {d.conditionLabel}
        </label>
        <select 
          id="pan-condition-select" 
          class="w-full bg-surface border border-hairline rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-sm text-ink font-medium focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-500 focus:outline-hidden"
        >
          {steelData.panConditions.map((cond) => (
            <option value={cond.id} selected={cond.id === 'mature-passivated-pristine'}>
              {cond.name}
            </option>
          ))}
        </select>
        <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-1.5">{d.conditionHelp}</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Food Matrix Select -->
      <div>
        <label for="food-matrix-select" class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-ink mb-2">
          {d.foodLabel}
        </label>
        <select 
          id="food-matrix-select" 
          class="w-full bg-surface border border-hairline rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-sm text-ink font-medium focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-500 focus:outline-hidden"
        >
          {steelData.foodMatrices.map((food) => (
            <option value={food.id} selected={food.id === 'tomato-marinara-sauce'}>
              {food.name} (pH {food.pH} &bull; {food.category})
            </option>
          ))}
        </select>
        <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-1.5">{d.foodHelp}</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Duration Slider -->
      <div>
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-2">
          <label for="duration-slider" class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-ink">
            {d.durationLabel}
          </label>
          <span id="duration-val" class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-slate-800 bg-slate-100 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-sm">
            180 mins (3.0 hrs)
          </span>
        </div>
        <input 
          type="range" 
          id="duration-slider" 
          min="10" 
          max="600" 
          step="10" 
          value="180" 
          class="w-full accent-slate-700 cursor-pointer"
        />
        <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-1">{d.durationHelp}</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Temperature Slider -->
      <div>
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-2">
          <label for="temp-slider" class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-ink">
            {d.tempLabel}
          </label>
          <span id="temp-val" class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-slate-800 bg-slate-100 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-sm">
            95°C (Simmering)
          </span>
        </div>
        <input 
          type="range" 
          id="temp-slider" 
          min="4" 
          max="110" 
          step="2" 
          value="95" 
          class="w-full accent-slate-700 cursor-pointer"
        />
        <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-1">{d.tempHelp}</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Serving Size Slider -->
      <div>
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-2">
          <label for="serving-slider" class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-ink">
            {d.servingsLabel}
          </label>
          <span id="serving-val" class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-slate-800 bg-slate-100 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-sm">
            250 g
          </span>
        </div>
        <input 
          type="range" 
          id="serving-slider" 
          min="100" 
          max="500" 
          step="25" 
          value="250" 
          class="w-full accent-slate-700 cursor-pointer"
        />
        <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-1">{d.servingsHelp}</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Diagnostic Scorecard Column (5 cols) -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-6">
      <div id="hazard-card" class="p-6 rounded-2xl border transition-all duration-300 bg-emerald-50 border-emerald-200">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-4">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted font-mono">
            {d.diagnosticTitle}
          </span>
          <span id="hazard-badge" class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-extrabold tracking-wide uppercase bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800">
            SAFE / LOW LEACHING
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-5">
          <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between mb-2">
            <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink">{d.hazardScoreLabel}</span>
            <span class="text-3xl font-black text-ink font-mono"><span id="hazard-score-num">14</span><span class="text-xs font-normal text-muted">/100</span></span>
          </div>
          <div class="w-full bg-surface/80 rounded-full h-3 overflow-hidden border border-hairline/80">
            <div id="hazard-progress-bar" class="h-full bg-emerald-500 transition-all duration-500" style="width: 14%;"></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Metric Grid -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 pt-4 border-t border-hairline/60">
          <div class="bg-surface p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-hairline">
            <span class="block text-2xs uppercase tracking-wider text-muted font-bold mb-1">{d.niLeachedLabel}</span>
            <span id="ni-ppm-display" class="text-base font-extrabold text-ink font-mono">28.4 µg/kg</span>
            <span class="block text-3xs text-muted mt-0.5">EU SRL: 140 µg/kg</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-surface p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-hairline">
            <span class="block text-2xs uppercase tracking-wider text-muted font-bold mb-1">{d.crLeachedLabel}</span>
            <span id="cr-ppm-display" class="text-base font-extrabold text-ink font-mono">45.2 µg/kg</span>
            <span class="block text-3xs text-muted mt-0.5">EU SRL: 250 µg/kg</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-surface p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-hairline">
            <span class="block text-2xs uppercase tracking-wider text-muted font-bold mb-1">{d.niDoseLabel}</span>
            <span id="ni-dose-display" class="text-base font-extrabold text-ink font-mono">7.1 µg</span>
            <span class="block text-3xs text-muted mt-0.5">EFSA TDI: 780 µg/day</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-surface p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-hairline">
            <span class="block text-2xs uppercase tracking-wider text-muted font-bold mb-1">{d.snasRiskLabel}</span>
            <span id="snas-risk-display" class="text-xs font-extrabold font-mono text-emerald-700">VERY LOW</span>
            <span class="block text-3xs text-muted mt-0.5">Threshold: 30 µg</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Compliance & Taste rows -->
        <div class="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-hairline/60 space-y-2.5">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
            <span class="text-muted">{d.coeComplianceLabel}:</span>
            <span id="coe-compliance-display" class="font-bold font-mono text-emerald-700">COMPLIANT (CM/Res(2013)9)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
            <span class="text-muted">{d.metallicTasteLabel}:</span>
            <span id="metallic-taste-display" class="font-bold font-mono text-emerald-700">UNDETECTABLE</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Action & Copy Report -->
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <button 
          type="button" 
          id="copy-report-btn" 
          class="flex-1 py-3 px-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-900 text-white font-medium text-xs text-center transition-colors shadow-xs flex items-center justify-center gap-2 cursor-pointer"
        >
          <span>📋</span>
          {d.copyReportBtn}
        </button>
        <span id="copy-feedback" class="text-xs font-bold text-emerald-700 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300">
          {d.copiedFeedback}
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Clinical Alert Banner -->
  <div id="clinical-alert-box" class="p-6 rounded-2xl border mb-10 bg-emerald-50 border-emerald-200 transition-all">
    <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
      <div id="alert-icon" class="text-3xl shrink-0">✅</div>
      <div>
        <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-ink mb-1">{d.alertTitle}</h4>
        <p id="alert-detailed-text" class="text-xs md:text-sm text-body leading-relaxed">
          Optimal metallurgical safety. Leached nickel and chromium remain far below European Council Specific Release Limits (SRL). Safe for general population consumption.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Reference Comparison Table -->
  <div class="mb-12">
    <div class="mb-4">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink mb-1">{d.tableTitle}</h3>
      <p class="text-xs text-muted">{d.tableSub}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-hairline bg-surface">
      <table class="w-full text-left text-xs md:text-sm">
        <thead class="bg-surface-soft border-b border-hairline text-muted uppercase tracking-wider text-3xs font-mono">
          <tr>
            <th class="py-3 px-4">{d.colGrade}</th>
            <th class="py-3 px-4">{d.colComposition}</th>
            <th class="py-3 px-4">{d.colPren}</th>
            <th class="py-3 px-4">{d.colNiContent}</th>
            <th class="py-3 px-4">{d.colAcidTolerance}</th>
            <th class="py-3 px-4">{d.colSnasSuitability}</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody class="divide-y divide-hairline">
          {steelData.steelGrades.map((g) => (
            <tr class="hover:bg-surface-soft/60 transition-colors">
              <td class="py-3 px-4 font-bold text-ink">{g.name}</td>
              <td class="py-3 px-4 text-muted text-xs">{g.composition}</td>
              <td class="py-3 px-4 font-mono font-medium">{g.prenScore}</td>
              <td class="py-3 px-4 font-mono font-bold {g.nickelPercent === 0 ? 'text-emerald-700' : 'text-slate-800'}">{g.nickelPercent}%</td>
              <td class="py-3 px-4 text-xs">{g.acidResistance}</td>
              <td class="py-3 px-4 text-xs font-semibold {g.nickelPercent <= 0.5 ? 'text-emerald-700' : 'text-amber-800'}">
                {g.nickelPercent <= 0.5 ? 'Safe / Clinically Recommended' : 'Avoid for Nickel Allergy / SNAS'}
              </td>
            </tr>
          ))}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 4 Golden Rules -->
  <div>
    <div class="mb-6">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink mb-1">{d.rulesTitle}</h3>
      <p class="text-xs text-muted">{d.rulesSub}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-surface-soft border border-hairline">
        <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-ink mb-2">{d.rule1Title}</h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-body leading-relaxed">{d.rule1Text}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-surface-soft border border-hairline">
        <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-ink mb-2">{d.rule2Title}</h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-body leading-relaxed">{d.rule2Text}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-surface-soft border border-hairline">
        <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-ink mb-2">{d.rule3Title}</h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-body leading-relaxed">{d.rule3Text}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-surface-soft border border-hairline">
        <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-ink mb-2">{d.rule4Title}</h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-body leading-relaxed">{d.rule4Text}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Client Calculation Script -->
<script is:inline define:vars={{ steelGrades: steelData.steelGrades, panConditions: steelData.panConditions, foodMatrices: steelData.foodMatrices }}>
  (function() {
    const gradeSelect = document.getElementById('steel-grade-select');
    const conditionSelect = document.getElementById('pan-condition-select');
    const foodSelect = document.getElementById('food-matrix-select');
    const durationSlider = document.getElementById('duration-slider');
    const durationVal = document.getElementById('duration-val');
    const tempSlider = document.getElementById('temp-slider');
    const tempVal = document.getElementById('temp-val');
    const servingSlider = document.getElementById('serving-slider');
    const servingVal = document.getElementById('serving-val');

    const hazardCard = document.getElementById('hazard-card');
    const hazardBadge = document.getElementById('hazard-badge');
    const hazardScoreNum = document.getElementById('hazard-score-num');
    const hazardProgressBar = document.getElementById('hazard-progress-bar');
    const niPpmDisplay = document.getElementById('ni-ppm-display');
    const crPpmDisplay = document.getElementById('cr-ppm-display');
    const niDoseDisplay = document.getElementById('ni-dose-display');
    const snasRiskDisplay = document.getElementById('snas-risk-display');
    const coeComplianceDisplay = document.getElementById('coe-compliance-display');
    const metallicTasteDisplay = document.getElementById('metallic-taste-display');
    const clinicalAlertBox = document.getElementById('clinical-alert-box');
    const alertIcon = document.getElementById('alert-icon');
    const alertDetailedText = document.getElementById('alert-detailed-text');

    const copyBtn = document.getElementById('copy-report-btn');
    const copyFeedback = document.getElementById('copy-feedback');
    const presetButtons = document.querySelectorAll('.preset-btn');

    function calculateLeaching() {
      const gradeId = gradeSelect.value;
      const conditionId = conditionSelect.value;
      const foodId = foodSelect.value;
      const durationMin = parseInt(durationSlider.value, 10);
      const tempC = parseInt(tempSlider.value, 10);
      const servingG = parseInt(servingSlider.value, 10);

      const hours = durationMin / 60;
      durationVal.textContent = durationMin < 60 ? `${durationMin} mins` : `${durationMin} mins (${(durationMin / 60).toFixed(1)} hrs)`;
      tempVal.textContent = tempC <= 10 ? `${tempC}°C (Cold Fridge Storage)` : tempC < 85 ? `${tempC}°C (Warm / Holding)` : tempC <= 98 ? `${tempC}°C (Simmering)` : `${tempC}°C (Rolling Boil / Reduction)`;
      servingVal.textContent = `${servingG} g`;

      const grade = steelGrades.find(g => g.id === gradeId) || steelGrades[0];
      const condition = panConditions.find(c => c.id === conditionId) || panConditions[0];
      const food = foodMatrices.find(f => f.id === foodId) || foodMatrices[0];

      // Arrhenius temperature factor: normalized to 95°C
      // T <= 10°C reduces kinetics but prolonged static contact still promotes micro-cell dissolution
      let tempFactor = 1.0;
      if (tempC <= 10) {
        tempFactor = 0.22;
      } else {
        tempFactor = Math.pow(1.032, (tempC - 70));
      }

      // Time factor: diffusion square-root damping for long boils
      const timeFactor = Math.pow(hours, 0.75);

      // Leached concentrations in µg/kg (ppb) of food
      let leachedNiUgKg = 0;
      let leachedCrUgKg = 0;

      if (grade.id !== 'enameled-vitreous-silicate') {
        leachedNiUgKg = grade.baseNiRateUgKgHr * food.matrixMultiplier * condition.multiplierNi * tempFactor * timeFactor;
        leachedCrUgKg = grade.baseCrRateUgKgHr * food.matrixMultiplier * condition.multiplierCr * tempFactor * timeFactor;
      }

      // Ingested nickel dose per serving (µg)
      const niDoseUg = (leachedNiUgKg * (servingG / 1000));
      const crDoseUg = (leachedCrUgKg * (servingG / 1000));

      niPpmDisplay.textContent = leachedNiUgKg < 0.1 ? '< 0.1 µg/kg' : `${leachedNiUgKg.toFixed(1)} µg/kg`;
      crPpmDisplay.textContent = leachedCrUgKg < 0.1 ? '< 0.1 µg/kg' : `${leachedCrUgKg.toFixed(1)} µg/kg`;
      niDoseDisplay.textContent = niDoseUg < 0.1 ? '< 0.1 µg' : `${niDoseUg.toFixed(1)} µg`;

      // Hazard index 0 to 100 calculation
      // Based on Council of Europe SRLs (Ni 140 µg/kg, Cr 250 µg/kg) and SNAS threshold (30 µg)
      let niRatio = leachedNiUgKg / 140.0;
      let crRatio = leachedCrUgKg / 250.0;
      let maxRatio = Math.max(niRatio, crRatio);

      let hazardScore = 0;
      if (grade.id === 'enameled-vitreous-silicate') {
        hazardScore = 1;
      } else {
        hazardScore = Math.min(100, Math.round(maxRatio * 60 + (niDoseUg > 25 ? 25 : (niDoseUg / 25) * 15)));
      }

      hazardScoreNum.textContent = hazardScore;
      hazardProgressBar.style.width = `${Math.min(100, Math.max(4, hazardScore))}%`;

      // SNAS Risk Evaluation
      if (niDoseUg < 5.0) {
        snasRiskDisplay.textContent = 'VERY LOW';
        snasRiskDisplay.className = 'text-xs font-extrabold font-mono text-emerald-700';
      } else if (niDoseUg < 20.0) {
        snasRiskDisplay.textContent = 'LOW-MODERATE';
        snasRiskDisplay.className = 'text-xs font-extrabold font-mono text-amber-700';
      } else if (niDoseUg < 40.0) {
        snasRiskDisplay.textContent = 'ELEVATED (FLARE RISK)';
        snasRiskDisplay.className = 'text-xs font-extrabold font-mono text-orange-700';
      } else {
        snasRiskDisplay.textContent = 'ACUTE SNAS TRIGGER';
        snasRiskDisplay.className = 'text-xs font-extrabold font-mono text-red-700';
      }

      // Council of Europe CM/Res(2013)9 compliance
      const isCoECompliant = (leachedNiUgKg <= 140.0 && leachedCrUgKg <= 250.0);
      if (isCoECompliant) {
        coeComplianceDisplay.textContent = 'COMPLIANT (CM/Res(2013)9)';
        coeComplianceDisplay.className = 'font-bold font-mono text-emerald-700';
      } else {
        coeComplianceDisplay.textContent = 'NON-COMPLIANT (EXCEEDS SRL)';
        coeComplianceDisplay.className = 'font-bold font-mono text-red-700';
      }

      // Metallic taste index
      const totalMetals = leachedNiUgKg + leachedCrUgKg;
      if (totalMetals < 80) {
        metallicTasteDisplay.textContent = 'UNDETECTABLE';
        metallicTasteDisplay.className = 'font-bold font-mono text-emerald-700';
      } else if (totalMetals < 250) {
        metallicTasteDisplay.textContent = 'FAINT METALLIC';
        metallicTasteDisplay.className = 'font-bold font-mono text-amber-700';
      } else {
        metallicTasteDisplay.textContent = 'DISTINCT METALLIC COIN TASTE';
        metallicTasteDisplay.className = 'font-bold font-mono text-red-700';
      }

      // Severity styling & clinical commentary
      if (hazardScore <= 25) {
        hazardCard.className = 'p-6 rounded-2xl border transition-all duration-300 bg-emerald-50 border-emerald-200';
        hazardBadge.className = 'px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-extrabold tracking-wide uppercase bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800';
        hazardBadge.textContent = 'SAFE / LOW LEACHING';
        hazardProgressBar.className = 'h-full bg-emerald-500 transition-all duration-500';
        clinicalAlertBox.className = 'p-6 rounded-2xl border mb-10 bg-emerald-50 border-emerald-200 transition-all';
        alertIcon.textContent = '✅';
        alertDetailedText.textContent = `Optimal metallurgical safety. Nickel concentration (${leachedNiUgKg.toFixed(1)} µg/kg) and chromium concentration (${leachedCrUgKg.toFixed(1)} µg/kg) remain comfortably within European Specific Release Limits. Oral intake is safe for the general population.`;
      } else if (hazardScore <= 55) {
        hazardCard.className = 'p-6 rounded-2xl border transition-all duration-300 bg-amber-50 border-amber-200';
        hazardBadge.className = 'px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-extrabold tracking-wide uppercase bg-amber-100 text-amber-800';
        hazardBadge.textContent = 'MODERATE MIGRATION / CAUTION';
        hazardProgressBar.className = 'h-full bg-amber-500 transition-all duration-500';
        clinicalAlertBox.className = 'p-6 rounded-2xl border mb-10 bg-amber-50 border-amber-200 transition-all';
        alertIcon.textContent = '⚠️';
        alertDetailedText.textContent = `Caution: Prolonged boiling in acidic conditions or unpassivated grain boundaries are driving measurable metal leaching. While acceptable for healthy adults, individuals sensitized to nickel (SNAS) may experience mild eczema or gastrointestinal symptoms from the ${niDoseUg.toFixed(1)} µg nickel portion.`;
      } else if (hazardScore <= 80) {
        hazardCard.className = 'p-6 rounded-2xl border transition-all duration-300 bg-orange-50 border-orange-200';
        hazardBadge.className = 'px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-extrabold tracking-wide uppercase bg-orange-100 text-orange-800';
        hazardBadge.textContent = 'HIGH MIGRATION HAZARD';
        hazardProgressBar.className = 'h-full bg-orange-500 transition-all duration-500';
        clinicalAlertBox.className = 'p-6 rounded-2xl border mb-10 bg-orange-50 border-orange-200 transition-all';
        alertIcon.textContent = '🚨';
        alertDetailedText.textContent = `High Heavy Metal Migration: Leached nickel (${leachedNiUgKg.toFixed(1)} µg/kg) or chromium approaches or exceeds European regulatory ceilings. High risk of triggering severe flare-ups in nickel-allergic individuals. Sauce may exhibit a perceptible metallic penny tang. Re-passivate pan with a 15-minute vinegar boil before future use.`;
      } else {
        hazardCard.className = 'p-6 rounded-2xl border transition-all duration-300 bg-red-50 border-red-300';
        hazardBadge.className = 'px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-extrabold tracking-wide uppercase bg-red-200 text-red-900 animate-pulse';
        hazardBadge.textContent = 'REGULATORY VIOLATION / CRITICAL RISK';
        hazardProgressBar.className = 'h-full bg-red-600 transition-all duration-500';
        clinicalAlertBox.className = 'p-6 rounded-2xl border mb-10 bg-red-50 border-red-300 transition-all';
        alertIcon.textContent = '☠️';
        alertDetailedText.textContent = `CRITICAL HAZARD: Massive metal leaching (${leachedNiUgKg.toFixed(1)} µg/kg Ni, ${leachedCrUgKg.toFixed(1)} µg/kg Cr) severely violates Council of Europe Resolution CM/Res(2013)9. Caused by combining severe surface abrasion or unpassivated low-grade steel with extreme acid and prolonged cooking. Discard or avoid frequent consumption of this batch.`;
      }
    }

    // Attach event listeners
    gradeSelect.addEventListener('change', calculateLeaching);
    conditionSelect.addEventListener('change', calculateLeaching);
    foodSelect.addEventListener('change', calculateLeaching);
    durationSlider.addEventListener('input', calculateLeaching);
    tempSlider.addEventListener('input', calculateLeaching);
    servingSlider.addEventListener('input', calculateLeaching);

    // Preset button handlers
    presetButtons.forEach(btn => {
      btn.addEventListener('click', function() {
        const p = this.getAttribute('data-preset');
        if (p === 'new-tomato') {
          gradeSelect.value = 'grade-304-18-10';
          conditionSelect.value = 'brand-new-unpassivated';
          foodSelect.value = 'tomato-marinara-sauce';
          durationSlider.value = 180;
          tempSlider.value = 95;
          servingSlider.value = 250;
        } else if (p === 'surgical-reduction') {
          gradeSelect.value = 'grade-316-surgical';
          conditionSelect.value = 'mature-passivated-pristine';
          foodSelect.value = 'lemon-vinegar-gastrique';
          durationSlider.value = 45;
          tempSlider.value = 100;
          servingSlider.value = 150;
        } else if (p === 'snas-430') {
          gradeSelect.value = 'grade-430-nickel-free';
          conditionSelect.value = 'mature-passivated-pristine';
          foodSelect.value = 'tomato-marinara-sauce';
          durationSlider.value = 180;
          tempSlider.value = 95;
          servingSlider.value = 250;
        } else if (p === 'scoured-broth') {
          gradeSelect.value = 'grade-304-18-10';
          conditionSelect.value = 'mechanically-scoured-steel-wool';
          foodSelect.value = 'bone-broth-cider-vinegar';
          durationSlider.value = 480;
          tempSlider.value = 90;
          servingSlider.value = 350;
        } else if (p === 'overnight-chili') {
          gradeSelect.value = 'grade-304-18-10';
          conditionSelect.value = 'mature-passivated-pristine';
          foodSelect.value = 'refrigerated-overnight-pot';
          durationSlider.value = 600;
          tempSlider.value = 4;
          servingSlider.value = 250;
        } else if (p === 'enamel-zero') {
          gradeSelect.value = 'enameled-vitreous-silicate';
          conditionSelect.value = 'mature-passivated-pristine';
          foodSelect.value = 'tomato-marinara-sauce';
          durationSlider.value = 180;
          tempSlider.value = 95;
          servingSlider.value = 250;
        }
        calculateLeaching();
      });
    });

    // Copy diagnostic report
    if (copyBtn) {
      copyBtn.addEventListener('click', function() {
        const report = `ISITKITCHENSAFE STAINLESS STEEL HEAVY METAL LEACHING REPORT
------------------------------------------------------------
Alloy Grade: ${gradeSelect.options[gradeSelect.selectedIndex].text}
Surface Condition: ${conditionSelect.options[conditionSelect.selectedIndex].text}
Food Matrix: ${foodSelect.options[foodSelect.selectedIndex].text}
Cooking Time: ${durationSlider.value} minutes
Cooking Temp: ${tempSlider.value}°C
Serving Size: ${servingSlider.value} g

DIAGNOSTIC FINDINGS:
Hazard Severity Score: ${hazardScoreNum.textContent} / 100 [${hazardBadge.textContent.trim()}]
Nickel (Ni) Concentration: ${niPpmDisplay.textContent} (EU SRL Limit: 140 µg/kg)
Chromium (Cr) Concentration: ${crPpmDisplay.textContent} (EU SRL Limit: 250 µg/kg)
Oral Nickel Intake per Serving: ${niDoseDisplay.textContent} (EFSA TDI: 780 µg/day)
SNAS / Nickel Allergy Risk: ${snasRiskDisplay.textContent}
EU CM/Res(2013)9 Compliance: ${coeComplianceDisplay.textContent}
Metallic Taste Index: ${metallicTasteDisplay.textContent}

CLINICAL & METALLURGICAL ASSESSMENT:
${alertDetailedText.textContent.trim()}
------------------------------------------------------------
Verified via IsItKitchenSafe Autonomous Growth & Ops Engine v2.0`;

        navigator.clipboard.writeText(report).then(() => {
          copyFeedback.style.opacity = '1';
          setTimeout(() => { copyFeedback.style.opacity = '0'; }, 3000);
        });
      });
    }

    calculateLeaching();
  })();
</script>
